{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_016_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cc38385c969d3f33b3e77c9e0f49f4c53d0772f8937ac6df5af72ef2dc62185c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_016_22:5_02_016_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa75cf61e8bf86fc71943e0bd76cbbf43c8eae5c7eda246dd55692f412d36541",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_016_22:5_02_016_22_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c2e5c5f9c20c080a187179a85500306fc169a036d7090be382240a8380a92fe",
      "text": "我准备了情人节的回礼。\n愿意收下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_016_22:5_02_016_22_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0c14c178269390b5303add312c83983369ee3f510d67711e9e95d68270e99b9",
      "text": "我听说在白色情人节这天，\n要还上情人节3倍的回礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_016_22:5_02_016_22_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ec29a1af1f2306da9c8f488179206a22dec18e7f57f0737805da7953551f186",
      "text": "我倾注了制作人在巧克力中倾注的\n3倍以上的心意挑选了这个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_016_22:5_02_016_22_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a86924f3733f0d5632347489e46ca705164115bf3bbae4af8296a3122c883bb0",
      "text": "要是能合你心意我就很高兴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_016_22:5_02_016_22_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dbade72254910d347513d385a0832ba9de610eb34ceeec16de89295d870d2f9",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n现在稍微方便占用一点时间吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_016_22:5_02_016_22_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ab477e3aefa2a680a5e02104aaf113f07d06d4f7ede0365f95a38a05b212d53",
      "text": "我准备了上个月的回礼。\n收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_016_22:5_02_016_22_b:cmd-000025:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15bac7d47b06ff8a7714b23234306bf040f2c2ee6ac8cbb68436b831164fc577",
      "text": "好的！非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_016_22:5_02_016_22_b:cmd-000026:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a54a021c5686e3321f0dea1fb44387de5b90f06aa713e74a2904229d7babfee8",
      "text": "特意为我准备了吗！好开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_016_22:5_02_016_22_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c06ccf352acac3946923cb6da701fc717a435b5ef53ad45e9958891f4aa1da8",
      "text": "你能高兴就比什么都好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_016_22:5_02_016_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af2cea7d29141e01f0cbb34808c30402c69d4f2d13c6aae0795f6037d686a3aa",
      "text": "多亏了那盒情人节巧克力，\n那天我发挥出了绝佳的舞台表现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_016_22:5_02_016_22_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ea8b73440588fbca1447d9ceea6bd081cccfcf9a76fd3431a54c35deef5f762",
      "text": "我反复思索了制作人可能会最喜欢的东西，\n挑选了这份回礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_016_22:5_02_016_22_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24e74366d6729749e96cf4aca5db488d7f6858c954e35c689992f04745c04410",
      "text": "要是能合你心意就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_016_22:5_02_016_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:346b49faeb62af024f027f822e6ad249b5c4e0da2d70109ed1e59aaf92a39008",
      "text": "再次向你道谢，情人节巧克力谢谢你。\n今后也请多指教了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
